# The eight navigation meshes OSP Tourney DM shipped precomputed, in the form
# they come out of `tourney-2.5-linux-x86-glibc.tar.gz` -- and, byte for byte,
# out of the win32 package beside it, which is how we know the set does not
# depend on which architecture's download you take.
#
# `.github/aas.sh` is the only thing that writes them into the tree and it
# hashes every one against this file, on the way in and again out of the staged
# package.  `sha256sum -c` reads it too, from `colosseum/maps/`.
